cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use vid2context in your research or project, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "vid2context: turn any video into context for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  vid2context turns videos into context for AI agents and large language
  models: transcripts, metadata, chapters and cited research briefs. It
  prefers existing captions and falls back to speech-to-text through a
  free-first chain of local, free-tier, keyless and paid providers, recording
  every attempt so results are traceable.
authors:
  - alias: nirholas
repository-code: "https://github.com/nirholas/vid2context"
url: "https://github.com/nirholas/vid2context"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - video transcription
  - youtube transcript
  - speech-to-text
  - model context protocol
  - ai agents
  - large language models
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - context engineering
